@startuml uSDK Flow
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20

title uSDK General Flow

actor "Mobile App\n(SDK)" as SDK
participant "Bidon SDK API\n(bidon-sdkapi)" as API
participant "Adapters\n(Adikteev, BidMachine, etc.)" as Adapters

== 1. /config — SDK Initialization ==

SDK -> API : GET /config\n{app_key, bundle, device, format}
activate API

API -> API : filter adapters\n(SDK version, COPPA, chardonnay hack)

API --> SDK : ConfigResponse\n{init_configs, token, segment_id, timeout}
deactivate API

== 2. SDK Collects Tokens ==

SDK -> SDK : collect adapter tokens\nbased on config

note over SDK
  SDK loads ad networks (adapters)
  and collects tokens from each.
  Token = adapter credential for RTB.
end note

== 3. /auction — Server-Side Auction ==

SDK -> API : POST /auction\n{auction_id, ad_object, adapters, device}
activate API


API -> Adapters : HoldAuction(result_units)
activate Adapters

Adapters -> API : return BidRespose
deactivate Adapters

API -> API : auction result (bids)

API -> API : buildAdUnitsMap()

API -> API : buildResponse()\nJSON with ad_units, no_bids, token, auction_id, price_floor

API --> SDK : AuctionResponse\n{ad_units, token, auction_id, price_floor, timeout}
deactivate API

== 4. SDK Client-Side Fill ==

SDK -> SDK : continue auction on client\nload units from most expensive to cheapest

note over SDK
  SDK tries to fill from:
  1. RTB winning bid
  2. Fall back to CPM line items (in order)
  3. If none fill: no_ads fallback

  line item = ad unit with fixed price (CPM)
  bid = ad unit with RTB price (Bidding)
end note

== 5. /stats — Post-Auction Stats ==

SDK -> API : POST /stats\n{ad_units[], statuses, prices}
activate API

API -> API : HandleStats(stats_data)

alt status == SUCCESS
    API -> API : compute first/second prices
    API -> API : send NURL to winner
    API -> API : send LURL to losers (reason: LostToHigherBid)
else status == FAIL
    API -> API : send LURL to all (reason: InternalError)
else status == AUCTION_CANCELLED
    API -> API : send LURL to all (reason: Expired)
end

loop for each notification
    API -> API : EventSender.SendEvent(url)\nHTTP GET with macro substitution\n${AUCTION_PRICE}, ${AUCTION_LOSS}, etc.\nexponential backoff (3 retries)
end

API --> SDK : HTTP 200 OK
deactivate API


@enduml
